{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/b512b868faa6a118acdd0d703c69940c.avif?t=1768957960\" alt=\"constructs\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/117c7a1d04ae674da51d902d222501d5.avif?t=1768957960\" alt=\"fight2\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/aef56aa4840653cbdbef20d999c32e18.avif?t=1768957960\" alt=\"construct1\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/092505045f27fc6bd25095e6c1d3a714.avif?t=1768957960\" alt=\"fight1\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>&quot;The Investiture of the Gods Sandbox Simulator&quot;</strong> is an epic sandbox simulation and management game based on the classic Chinese mythology <strong>&quot;The Investiture of the Gods&quot;</strong>. You will be thrust into the grand conflict between the Shang and Zhou dynasties, taking on the role of legendary heroes like <strong>Nezha</strong> or <strong>Jiang Ziya</strong>, commanding the Zhou army to besiege the Shang capital, <strong>Zhaoge</strong>. The game's ultimate appeal lies in its <strong>cross-temporal, genre-blending warfare</strong> \u2014 command your forces to battle against <strong>Japanese samurai, Roman knights, and American line infantry from the Civil War era</strong> on the same battlefield. Experience unprecedented, large-scale immersive war simulation in epic clashes featuring <strong>2,000 units on screen simultaneously</strong>, creating a unique mythological tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25ba [Grand Strategy: Govern and Prosper]</strong><br>Build and manage your prosperous capital from the ground up. Meticulously control population, resources, and economic lifelines to forge the sturdiest logistical stronghold for your frontline wars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25ba [Armies Assembled: Epic Battles]</strong><br>Train multi-type legions including infantry, cavalry, and spearmen. Experience real-time deployment, tactical maneuvering, and the thrill of commanding large-scale frontal battles with thousands of units on screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25ba [Mythical Heroes: Unstoppable Force]</strong><br>Personally control divine generals like <strong>Nezha</strong> and <strong>Yang Jian</strong> as they charge into enemy formations, unleashing dazzling skills to sweep through thousands, delivering the exhilarating &quot;one-against-all&quot; action experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, deep strategy, macro-management, and thrilling action blend perfectly to create a monumental <strong>Chinese-mythology-inspired masterpiece</strong>. Join now and write your own legendary conquest epic!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895300?t=1768957960","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895300?t=1768957960","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/e377b5df13cf922998c450e6dfce6cb446208430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768957960","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/e377b5df13cf922998c450e6dfce6cb446208430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768957960","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/b512b868faa6a118acdd0d703c69940c.avif?t=1768957960\" alt=\"constructs\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/117c7a1d04ae674da51d902d222501d5.avif?t=1768957960\" alt=\"fight2\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/aef56aa4840653cbdbef20d999c32e18.avif?t=1768957960\" alt=\"construct1\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/extras/092505045f27fc6bd25095e6c1d3a714.avif?t=1768957960\" alt=\"fight1\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>&quot;The Investiture of the Gods Sandbox Simulator&quot;</strong> is an epic sandbox simulation and management game based on the classic Chinese mythology <strong>&quot;The Investiture of the Gods&quot;</strong>. You will be thrust into the grand conflict between the Shang and Zhou dynasties, taking on the role of legendary heroes like <strong>Nezha</strong> or <strong>Jiang Ziya</strong>, commanding the Zhou army to besiege the Shang capital, <strong>Zhaoge</strong>. The game's ultimate appeal lies in its <strong>cross-temporal, genre-blending warfare</strong> \u2014 command your forces to battle against <strong>Japanese samurai, Roman knights, and American line infantry from the Civil War era</strong> on the same battlefield. Experience unprecedented, large-scale immersive war simulation in epic clashes featuring <strong>2,000 units on screen simultaneously</strong>, creating a unique mythological tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25ba [Grand Strategy: Govern and Prosper]</strong><br>Build and manage your prosperous capital from the ground up. Meticulously control population, resources, and economic lifelines to forge the sturdiest logistical stronghold for your frontline wars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25ba [Armies Assembled: Epic Battles]</strong><br>Train multi-type legions including infantry, cavalry, and spearmen. Experience real-time deployment, tactical maneuvering, and the thrill of commanding large-scale frontal battles with thousands of units on screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25ba [Mythical Heroes: Unstoppable Force]</strong><br>Personally control divine generals like <strong>Nezha</strong> and <strong>Yang Jian</strong> as they charge into enemy formations, unleashing dazzling skills to sweep through thousands, delivering the exhilarating &quot;one-against-all&quot; action experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, deep strategy, macro-management, and thrilling action blend perfectly to create a monumental <strong>Chinese-mythology-inspired masterpiece</strong>. Join now and write your own legendary conquest epic!</p>","developers":["GUO CHENGHAO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895300/f9e1ae0a7e04a39c5d810198683640a66fec3f33/header.jpg?t=1768957960","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895300/177825977/6b5ad931354773c0043a99f2047881d96727294f/1768871129/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768872248","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895300/177825977/6b5ad931354773c0043a99f2047881d96727294f/1768871129/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768872248","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895300/1778